# Jayashree Industrial Project Lead Intelligence

Streamlit dashboard for reviewing Indian industrial project news and prioritising potential conveyor and material-handling sales leads.

## Run locally

```text
pip install -r requirements.txt
python news_collector.py
python lead_classifier.py
streamlit run app.py
```

The dashboard reads from `data/leads.db`. The database is included so the deployed app opens with the current lead set.

## Weekly refresh

GitHub Actions runs the collector and classifier every Monday at 9:00 AM India Standard Time (03:30 UTC), commits any database changes, and Streamlit Community Cloud redeploys from the updated repository.


